 "summary": "The OpenDRIVE V1.9.0 model with the changes below. Each makes the model say, in terms a UML reader understands, what the normative schema says, or corrects a defect the model and the schema share. Changes marked *unchanged* leave the normative schema exactly as it is; the others change it, and say how.",
